<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Yury Sviatoslavich</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1407</span> · Also known as Yury Svyatoslavich of Smolensk</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Yury Sviatoslavich was the last independent prince of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/smolensk">Smolensk</a>. Driven out when Vytautas of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lithuania">Lithuania</a> took the city in 1395, he regained it with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ryazan">Ryazan</a>'s help in 1401, but Vytautas besieged Smolensk again and annexed it in 1404. Yury fled to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/moscow">Moscow</a> and later to Novgorod, and died in exile.</p></div>
